00:04:44.149 --> 00:04:45.711
(Garnt and Joey chuckling)
- Yeah, no time.

00:04:45.711 --> 00:04:47.790
- It's like oh cool I have
three days off last month.

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:48.890
