00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:56.040
Because I remember when
I first moved to Japan,

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.070
I thought, who needs a calendar?

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:00.300
We're YouTubers, we don't need calendars.

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.840
We make our own schedule.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.730
You move to Japan and
slowly, you're just like,

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:05.640
maybe I need a calendar to just to like,

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.437
keep track of like one or two days.

00:05:07.437 --> 00:05:09.780
And then more stuff keeps creeping in

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:10.777
and then you're just like, oh wait!

00:05:10.777 --> 00:05:13.436
I need to put my personal
life for my calendar as well.

00:05:13.436 --> 00:05:14.269
(Joey laughs)

00:05:14.269 --> 00:05:15.880
Because like, now I don't know

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.430
