00:05:44.026 --> 00:05:45.212
- "Deborah, pencil it in."

00:05:45.212 --> 00:05:46.227
(Garnt laughing)

00:05:46.227 --> 00:05:47.397
- "Oh, do I have time for this meeting?

00:05:47.397 --> 00:05:49.240
