00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:55.421
- I think, I'd ironically
want an assistant.

00:05:55.421 --> 00:05:56.870
(Group laughs)
- Yeah right?

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:58.580
- I know that sounds terrible.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.390
I felt like what the fuck
I would never want one.

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:01.223
