00:06:50.277 --> 00:06:52.100
But like, I mean some days like,

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:54.700
I don't know about three,
four days of the week.

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:56.430
I pretty much fill my schedule up,

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:59.690
