to pencil in to watch Anime.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.080
And like the time I pencil in

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.507
to watch Anime is like this.

00:08:16.507 --> 00:08:18.537
The time I pencil in to
make videos is like that.

00:08:18.537 --> 00:08:19.370
- [Joey and Connor] Yeah.

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:20.720
- This is like the equivalent like doctors

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:22.450
having to like study new practices

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:23.283
to stay on top of their game.

00:08:23.283 --> 00:08:26.170
And so I have to watch Anime, it's R&amp;D

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:28.665
- I just love to think
that like, if I was like,

00:08:28.665 --> 00:08:29.957
