00:10:41.701 --> 00:10:43.080
(Joey laughing)
these easy tips?

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.310
- Honestly dude like,

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:46.184
especially when it comes to like Al stuff,

00:10:46.184 --> 00:10:49.890
because we have so many
things that we have to do,

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:52.210
