00:14:35.731 --> 00:14:37.830
And you're just like your
life's kind of in limbo

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:39.240
until you get that confirmation

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:41.887
to be like, "Oh, okay,
finally, I can start packing.

00:14:41.887 --> 00:14:43.590
