decide to do something else?

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:10.193
And then like hope,

00:15:10.193 --> 00:15:11.670
and hope that you can just then go back?

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:13.650
I don't know?
- I think for most students,

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:16.060
I don't think anyone was anticipating them

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:18.160
to fuckin stay in limbo
for two years right?

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:19.947
So, I'm sure the majority
of students were like,

00:15:19.947 --> 00:15:22.740
"Oh, I still got time, I can wait."

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:25.210
- Oh fuck imagine losing
two years of like,

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:27.300
I guess, progress you could
have made in your 20s.

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:28.133
- Yeah, yeah.

00:15:28.133 --> 00:15:29.980
- But then again, it's
not really that important

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:31.560
because I guess a lot of people

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:33.320
in life didn't start doing

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.750
their main thing until they were like 40s.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:35.780
So I guess it really
doesn't fuckin matter.

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:36.613
- Oh yeah, yeah, true, true.

00:15:36.613 --> 00:15:38.200
- I mean but, I think what sucks

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.970
is that you just have two years where

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:42.579
you can't really commit to something.

00:15:42.579 --> 00:15:44.990
That's what really sucks for me,

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:47.680
where I always want to have a goal

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:48.590
that I'm working towards

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:51.570
and know that I'm actively
working towards that goal.

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:53.900
'Cause one of my biggest
pet peeves is like,

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:56.070
if I'm feeling like I'm not
working towards something,

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:57.240
then I just feel lost.

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:59.520
And I just feel like a fuckin lost soul.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:02.900
And I need something
concrete to work towards.

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.260
That's why like I really empathize

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:05.640
with anyone waiting for a visa.

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:07.590
